OL,3,GNEWSARebuilding our estate could
OL,4,A'separate' families
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn #80m plan to demolish and regenerate
OL,7,Fa city council estate could result in
OL,8,Ffamilies being "separated", a resident
OL,9,Fhas warned.
OL,11,FCambridge City Council has proposed
OL,12,Fdemolishing the existing homes and the
OL,13,Fshopping precinct at Arbury Court,
OL,14,Freplacing them with more than 200 new
OL,15,Fhomes, community facilities and
OL,16,Fcommercial units.
OL,18,FGerri Bird, Labour cabinet member for
OL,19,Fhousing, said the authority would do
OL,20,F"its upmost to make sure everything is
OL,21,FOK for the resident and shopkeepers".
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,375,370,200,160,0,100
